* @title Gimpel binary tree insertion and linearization
* @attribution James F. Gimpel, Algorithms in SNOBOL4, Chapters 13.8 and 13.9; Catspaw SNOBOL4+ program diskette
* @expect >>>
* ALPHA 1
* BRAVO 1
* CHARLIE 1
* DELTA 1
* <<<
-INCLUDE "INSERT.INC"
-INCLUDE "LINEARIZ.INC"
	T = INSERT(T,'DELTA')
	T = INSERT(T,'ALPHA')
	T = INSERT(T,'CHARLIE')
	T = INSERT(T,'BRAVO')
	L = LINEARIZE(T)
LOOP	OUTPUT = VALUE(L) ' ' NO(L)
	L = DIFFER(RSON(L)) RSON(L)     :S(LOOP)
END
